(Reading and writing to /dev/console and physical ttys)SH
/Symbol SF
9242 41913 MT
(\267)SH
/Helvetica SF
9980 XM
(Some Unix signal semantics)SH
/Symbol SF
9242 43728 MT
(\267)SH
/Helvetica SF
9980 XM
(Fork and exec)SH
/Symbol SF
9242 45543 MT
(\267)SH
/Helvetica SF
9980 XM
(Pipe and redirection semantics)SH
12 /Helvetica-Bold AF
7200 47529 MT
(Unix features not supported by POE)SH
10 /Symbol AF
9242 49099 MT
(\267)SH
